<title>PORTUGAL: Escudo recovers vs mark on dlr strength.</title>
<headline>Escudo recovers vs mark on dlr strength.</headline>
<text>
<p>1650 GMT - The escudo closed firmer against the mark in line with other currencies, benefiting from a stronger dollar, and dealers said they expected another quiet session tomorrow, dictated by crosses against the German currency. The escudo closed at 101.37/40 per mark, compared with 101.45/49 at the opening.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
